Make next reqests
1.Get a list of all the children along with the institution they are in and their class track
SELECT 
    C.first_name, 
    C.last_name, 
    I.institution_name, 
    CL.class_name, 
    CL.direction
FROM 
    Children C
JOIN 
    Institutions I ON C.institution_id = I.institution_id
JOIN 
    Classes CL ON C.class_id = CL.class_id;

+------------+-----------+------------------+------------+-----------------------+
| first_name | last_name | institution_name | class_name | direction             |
+------------+-----------+------------------+------------+-----------------------+
| Child      | Anonymous | Institution1     | Grade 1    | Mathematics           |
| Child      | Anonymous | Institution2     | Preschool  | Language Studies      |
| Child      | Anonymous | Institution3     | Grade 9    | Biology and Chemistry |
